# ============================================
# Postfix Header Checks
# Regex-based header filtering
# ============================================

# Remove unwanted headers from incoming mail
/^Received:/                IGNORE
/^X-Originating-IP:/        IGNORE
/^X-Mailer:/                IGNORE
/^User-Agent:/              IGNORE
/^X-Enigmail:/              IGNORE

# Block common spam patterns
/^Subject:.*\b(viagra|cialis|casino|lottery|winner)\b/i    REJECT Spam detected
/^Subject:.*\$\$\$/                                         REJECT Spam detected
/^Subject:.*\bmake money\b/i                                REJECT Spam detected
/^Subject:.*\benlarge\b/i                                   REJECT Spam detected

# Block phishing attempts
/^Subject:.*\bverify your account\b/i                       REJECT Phishing attempt
/^Subject:.*\bupdate your information\b/i                   REJECT Phishing attempt
/^Subject:.*\bsuspended account\b/i                         REJECT Phishing attempt

# Block malicious content
/^Content-Type:.*executable/                                REJECT Executable content not allowed
/^Content-Disposition:.*\.exe/i                             REJECT Executable attachments blocked
/^Content-Disposition:.*\.scr/i                             REJECT Screen saver attachments blocked
/^Content-Disposition:.*\.bat/i                             REJECT Batch file attachments blocked
/^Content-Disposition:.*\.cmd/i                             REJECT Command file attachments blocked
/^Content-Disposition:.*\.pif/i                             REJECT PIF file attachments blocked